  m_text: 'Hello!  I''m Argonox IX, son of Argonox VIII!

    Welcome to my shop!
    Please have a look through the categories on the right and see if there''s anything
    you like.  I just got a new shipment of <i>Ion Reactors</i> that I''m trying
    to unload, so there''s a nice discount!'
